    "body": "I don't think you should check the qualified name; it would pick up a namespaced attribute with that name (can be set with `setAttributeNS()`). Also, `link`'s sizes attribute is named `imagesizes`.\r\n\r\nSay: If *child* has a [sizes attribute](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#sizes-attribute) present, ...",
